  "name": "Germir Palas Hotel - Special Class",
  "starRating": 3,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "1143555"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Germir Palas Hotel - Special Class, you\u0027ll be centrally located in Istanbul, a 6-minute walk from Taksim Square and 11 minutes by foot from Istiklal Avenue.  This hotel is 1.7 mi (2.7 km) from Galata Tower and 2 mi (3.2 km) from Galataport."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 49 air-conditioned rooms featuring iPod docking stations and LED televisions. Your pillowtop bed comes with premium bedding. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and digital programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with showers feature rainfall showerheads and complimentary toiletries."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Take advantage of recreation opportunities such as a fitness center or take in the view from a terrace and a garden. Additional amenities at this Baroque hotel include complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and wedding services."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EAcibadem Taksim Hospital - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Taksim Square - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Vodafone Park - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istiklal Avenue - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Congress Center - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lutfi Kirdar Convention and Exhibition Centre - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dolmabah\u00E7e Palace - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bosphorus - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Pera Palace Hotel - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galataport - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Museum of Modern Art - 2.2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galata Tower - 2.2 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E American Hospital - 2.2 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Besiktas Pier - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Cruise Ship Terminal - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EIstanbul Sabiha Gokcen Intl. Airport (SAW) - 61.6 km / 38.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Airport (IST) - 38.6 km / 24 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property uses eco-friendly cleaning products\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, a first aid kit, and window guards\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-in and contactless check-out are available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Grab a bite at Bistro Germir Palas, one of the hotel\u0027s 3 restaurants, or stay in and take advantage of the 24-hour room service. Snacks are also available at the coffee shop/cafe. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
